steps.text:
The number of colours depends on the crystal system:

• <b>isotropic</b> (cubic or amorphous: spinel, garnet, glass): no difference, the two windows are the same;
• <b>uniaxial</b>: two colours, this is <b>dichroism</b> (ruby, sapphire, emerald);
• <b>biaxial</b>: up to three colours, this is <b>trichroism</b> (tanzanite, iolite).
